        <mxCell id="gaps_text" value="• state.py: 12 steps (missing security_check) vs orchestrator.md: 13 steps — state.py needs update&#xa;• No reviewer agent defined — step 7 (CODE_REVIEW) has context.py support but no agent prompt&#xa;• No security subtask template in templates/ (only analyst, developer, tester exist)&#xa;• Token tracking not wired: record_agent_run() exists but never called by orchestrator&#xa;• MCP Search is mocked — no real integration&#xa;• No tests for agent_contract.py, metrics.py, reports/&#xa;• Git push blocked — SSH keys generated but can't add to GitHub via PAT&#xa;• Graph-Mem MCP requires venv — uvx lacks sentence-transformers dependency" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
